@startuml
title 表格式升级的五道兼容性门槛

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #475569

rectangle "目标表能力\nFormat v2 + Row-level Delete" as target #FEE2E2

rectangle "Reader\n能否解析 v2 metadata\n能否应用 delete files" as reader #E0F2FE
rectangle "Writer\n能否正确写 sequence number\n能否提交目标操作" as writer #FEF3C7
rectangle "Catalog\n加载方式、锁/CAS、权限" as catalog #F8FAFC
rectangle "SQL / API\nMERGE、UPDATE、DELETE\n是否需要 extensions" as sql #F8FAFC
rectangle "Maintenance\nrewrite、expire、orphan 清理" as maintenance #DCFCE7

reader --> writer
writer --> catalog
catalog --> sql
sql --> maintenance
maintenance --> target

note bottom of target
  只有所有生产访问路径都验证通过，
  才能修改 format-version；升级不可当场降级
end note
@enduml
